{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/i8meaqqmov97w37fdt4w0726vs3folt.mp3","text":"这个办公室怎么这么冷！喂，那个能烧吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9a/pd6d5lulwi7m4wulzqsm5ubjppygx4z.mp3","text":"欸？这本书很贵吗？嘻嘻，叫我一声伊芙利特大人，我就还给你！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a5/1d9xye1cd23kia1s0jxvuycdh1tfxbu.mp3","text":"什么？要我读这本书？我最讨厌的就是......唔？赫、赫默是这样说的吗？呃......这、这个字怎么念啊？","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/06/soouikrvkie6i1vcbxbmd2i9dths11n.mp3","text":"我最讨厌穿白大褂的家伙盯着我看......就是在说你啊！在说你！别看了，脸转过去！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/51/96ngk9wcjhfdj025wg3zf16rcnq4fpv.mp3","text":"唔呃......我知道啦，不会再用火吓唬大家了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/62/k7n0mbabi32xhljroxfefv4qh8hxp16.mp3","text":"退后面去！你......靠近我是想干什么？难道你也想把我放到试验台上......？","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:0/04/3sbb4h7i0gqlkz3t83njmups1ey5s86.mp3","text":"塞雷娅来了吗？让我去见——赫默不准？无所谓的吧？你带我偷偷过去不就好了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/83/9j5s83rtpjs96cx5wk5mqklx5xc0mps.mp3","text":"赫默和塞雷娅，她们究竟为什么吵架？真搞不懂......喂！有没有什么阻止她们的办法？告诉我吧......？","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e9/hkvkp7fen3p6sbgv7z58dapxi1dw3ay.mp3","text":"你怎么对待我都无所谓，对赫默绝对要温柔。她想要什么你都帮她尽力实现！如果你真能做到，从今以后，我就都听你的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/n8dm7vselq92bn6s6ln7tdifbjwkxd9.mp3","text":"你这家伙，把我晾在一边一个人睡大觉，胆子很大啊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/3ctgedgb7qvdi8jo9zedv13ywan5k7z.mp3","text":"我就是伊芙利特！赫默说罗德岛是个好地方，但我不喜欢你们这些穿白大衣的家伙......除了赫默之外。","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/l7y1b3lk7zwzmsj1na23pvg9ugomtic.mp3","text":"强化？唔，就是我的火焰能烧得更旺，这种感觉？","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1d/ej1x78do2a8r9avcjsdwervetcj84a1.mp3","text":"这是什么？罗德岛干员晋升手册？干什么啊，晋升之后还有这么多麻烦规矩？我才不干！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/dljt2su7io8h4u3pp1gkttyobu5i2pz.mp3","text":"嘻嘻，这就对了嘛！那些条条框框我都不懂。反正你需要我的帮助，光这一句就够了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/tp2ad5dpnvkqnrw8myjevjml3nsovzc.mp3","text":"知道啦知道啦！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/qybhi9wer6srx1mk1rfk4a4u97dsisf.mp3","text":"我是队长？像赫默那样做就行了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:3/32/azhr0g3rvda2huq74sxfrmb0baka0ob.mp3","text":"喂，说好了我是队长，我来下出击命令才对吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b6/6ljgrauml11bwy3ze2hpwbadl83adb8.mp3","text":"哟，来一次久违的烧烤吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/hd0cmwwsvr4q6280y1w37nv4jomnkh9.mp3","text":"喂！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/21/e5lng4lir0dxar77ohypri4zf699cmi.mp3","text":"真慢！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:1/13/h7w4nf5wee561yud6p46qr8qb08ovmc.mp3","text":"大地，沸腾吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/bm4t9e6afoal5r409gcgfd798uy8p9b.mp3","text":"地狱，随时填装！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:4/40/5nj0d18hxw8rdyi3mjsihgrz01n732m.mp3","text":"疼吗？疼吗！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/4d6mqj33o6iurovakb7mbc5ozuz2140.mp3","text":"哈哈！再多叫几声！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/dauoavphhdpsgp6179t03ndn12b8opo.mp3","text":"没人在乎你的惨叫！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/69/j0tqpecrtekzw6yg1ni9982daixop64.mp3","text":"排好队！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/54/tjnctdozmqy3vmsqkbmyrjqg88o5hzs.mp3","text":"不够！完全不够！根本没人能打败我！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/qoy7fyezafteen8q7pfr02tssb04g2w.mp3","text":"这么多废弃物，一把火烧个干净吧？会很暖和的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/53/oybluj2zea643cg2lysoc51hyvbbrbc.mp3","text":"焦炭，满地焦炭，这种战斗我一个人就足够了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/balnopevl7a31ejuwy9dd2hslmhlijp.mp3","text":"可恶......你......都是你的原因，让我出丑！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:4/46/nn5ufyx1o5zptr0wpsrv5su0firhj9g.mp3","text":"这里是什么地方啊？","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/lqwq3ex8keqj7347dsmzafcvxzzvhym.mp3","text":"干什么！放开我！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/hyz7m44jdifstqvi7x0naby10wfsfdy.mp3","text":"嘻嘻，你这家伙对我还挺好嘛，想和我一起玩吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/3mfvdcj1vjk1ddaq7dibrza02cz4ben.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:5/55/b37hftozak86cgiimees1v9ncdv3mrl.mp3","text":"新年？哼，别小瞧我，新年是什么意思赫默早就教给我了，不就是庆祝一年过去，为新一年规划新目标之类的嘛！我的新目标？喂，你拿着作业过来干什么，赫默都说了今天我可以不用写的！走开啊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/5jjd86on455nr76e4y84gzpymx7eyjd.mp3","text":"啊？找我有事吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_134_ifrit/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/7j48jefq2a1a1pv3o5es8ezl72vn802.mp3","text":"这个办公室怎么这么冷！喂，那个能烧吗？","alt":"voice/char_134_ifrit/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/gd74hvfw43ohwrr9fsrcbau1h51805t.mp3","text":"欸？这本书很贵吗？嘻嘻，叫我一声伊芙利特大人，我就还给你！","alt":"voice/char_134_ifrit/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/de/08oluquy1jzxsfqx1bfy80v6mviqc7d.mp3","text":"什么？要我读这本书？我最讨厌的就是......唔？赫、赫默是这样说的吗？呃......这、这个字怎么念啊？","alt":"voice/char_134_ifrit/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/dnlhf1mm1n9l5xgnmymc7ufjpqbgni0.mp3","text":"我最讨厌穿白大褂的家伙盯着我看......就是在说你啊！在说你！别看了，脸转过去！","alt":"voice/char_134_ifrit/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/juibp0wkhy1vhpkntf136miva8av5oj.mp3","text":"唔呃......我知道啦，不会再用火吓唬大家了。","alt":"voice/char_134_ifrit/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/k4xx2a3lpvnxsixfjj5tvgf4zjgw8ld.mp3","text":"退后面去！你......靠近我是想干什么？难道你也想把我放到试验台上......？","alt":"voice/char_134_ifrit/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:1/16/7ejr89rfwddr9q535ybxfoisjkhegdm.mp3","text":"塞雷娅来了吗？让我去见——赫默不准？无所谓的吧？